OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPCs who used Taser and baton on
OL,4,Aamputee, 92, sacked
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo police officers who pepper-sprayed
OL,7,Fand Tasered a 92-year-old amputee at a
OL,8,Fcare home have been sacked for gross
OL,9,Fmisconduct.
OL,11,FPC Stephen Smith and PC Rachel Comotto,
OL,12,Fwho were both acquitted of assault
OL,13,Foccasioning actual bodily harm in May
OL,14,F2025, had been called to Park Beck care
OL,15,Fhome in St Leonards-on-Sea after
OL,16,Fresident Donald Burgess threatened
OL,17,Fcarers with a dinner knife.
OL,19,FBurgess, who had dementia, was hit with
OL,20,Fa baton, pepper sprayed and Tasered as
OL,21,Fhe sat in his wheelchair in his bedroom
OL,22,Fin June 2022.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
