OL,3,GNEWSAPCs who used Taser and baton on
OL,4,Aamputee, 92, sacked
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Sussex Police headquarters in Lewes
OL,7,Fearlier, a disciplinary panel decided
OL,8,Fthere had been "unjustified and
OL,9,Fexcessive use of force" and dismissed
OL,10,Fboth officers without notice.
